{"title":"Orc","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 9 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(580.7px,81.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-1024px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-4/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-1024px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-583.0px;top:-64.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-577.5px;top:-70.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-558.2px;top:-90.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-563.7px;top:-90.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-577.5px;top:-86.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-624.2px;top:-85.3px\"></i></div><figcaption>Orc Camp</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"orc\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Orc: <a href=\"#/monster/orc-grunt\">Orc Grunt</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warrior\">Orc Warrior</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-shieldwall\">Orc Shieldwall</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-berserker\">Orc Berserker</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/orc-warchief\">Orc Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b7b08b1297aad45198de.svg\" alt=\"Orc\"></div><h3>Orc</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>9 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 12–12)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Orc</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>28</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>9.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}